  "method": "Float32 native values, 6-hourly 0.25-degree global grid. One (1,1,H,W) chunk per real input plane, serial 2D LINEAR Falcons. Per-plane ABS=(max-min)*1e-3. E2E batch_size=1, one fork DataLoader worker, one history and one future, slide by one and reuse overlapping frames. Both routes return tensors on one DCU and include a device reduction and synchronization. One warmup batch, gated prefetch and warm file/page cache. Three sequential independent windows per configuration, alternating routes and rotating 1/8/16 readers across rounds; report median. Excludes setup, source fetch, encoding, validation, model training and cold-disk I/O. CPU parallel reader is a benchmark-only adapter. Reader count includes the worker, not additional workers. DCU route uses the production Python package, CPU decodes entropy before device reconstruction.",
